// Paste: text (the system clipboard, gfx_clip_get) replaces the selection as one undo step. When it is the plain text of ctl.clip the user pasted what was copied here, so the fragment goes in with its character and paragraph rows; anything else goes in as plain text in the typing properties. Empty text does nothing.
editor_paste(Doc d, Ctl ctl, string text) {
  if(len(text) > 0) {
    editor_paste_do(d, ctl, text);
  }
} return void;
